e-scss-module__ubvNPq__problemDescription"><p>There is a chessboard of size=
 <code>n x n</code>. Your goal is to place <code>n</code> queens on the boa=
rd such that <strong>no two queens attack each other</strong>. Return the n=
umber of distinct configurations where this is possible.</p><h4 id=3D"examp=
le">Example:</h4><figure class=3D"py-1"><div style=3D"display:flex;justify-=
